 es 6,4, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 4,2 a 9,8. En diciembre se adjudicó el 9 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 11 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 46 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.940 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no refleja actos ilícitos, sino decisiones basadas en presupuestos y necesidades. El límite legal no implica irregularidades, ya que puede ser una estrategia de gestión financiera.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos al límite se reparten entre distintos proveedores. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en áreas similares. Analizar si los contratos de diciembre se encajan en un plan anual de gastos.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 55 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 8.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 6.4, with a 95% confidence interval of 4.2 to 9.8. December accounts for 9% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 11% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 3. Contract [1], for 14,940 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The data shows that some contracts are just under the limit, but it doesn't prove any wrongdoing. Prices might be set by market rates or budgets. Legal limits are meant to prevent excessive spending, but small differences don't always mean violations.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of the December contracts to see if they fit a pattern. Review awardee A's contracts to see if they repeat the same type of service. Look at contract [1] to see what was purchased and how it fits within the annual budget.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["jS3jd6l5nZaFQ%2FlhRK79lA%3D%3D","%2FW4hW7jrDxkmMOlAXxDEjw%3D%3D","MeuvYx0EaGhVq4S9zvaQpQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}